"satzungsmäßigen Frist gelöscht."
msgstr ""
"Write down the code. After the vote ends you can check in the exported "
"ballot list that your vote was recorded correctly — and recount the overall "
"result independently with <code>verify/nachrechnen.py</code> (§ 5 (8)). Only"
" the platform knows the pseudonym-to-person mapping; it is deleted after the"
" period set by the statutes."

